        "pull_request.edited",
        "repo_trails.base"
      ],
      "text": "For PR-backed Trails, `repo_trails.base` can become stale after a GitHub PR is retargeted because `pull_request.edited` updates the PR record but not the linked trail; mergeability, update-branch, merge, and CI then use the stale trail base instead of the PR base, which can make Trails report a branch current against `main` while its stacked PR remains behind or conflicting.",
