      ],
      "text": "Filtered fetches by remote name were rejected because Git persists promisor and partial-clone settings into `.git/config`, silently altering users’ fetch/pull behavior repo-wide; use URL-based filtered fetches behind the rollout flag, and revisit remote-name fetching only if Git no longer mutates remote configuration.",
