      ],
      "kind": "decision",
      "text": "Stale unresolved checkpoints must be re-fetched on later syncs and updated in place, so agent, model, and session metadata backfill automatically once checkpoint-repository discovery or access succeeds without creating duplicate checkpoint rows.",
